# Lab 05 - EIGRP and OSPF Redistribution

## Objectives

Configure and verify:

- EIGRP to OSPF redistribution
- OSPF to EIGRP redistribution
- Redistribution metrics
- External routes
- Route verification
- Route filtering


# Topology

R1
 |
EIGRP AS 100
 |
R2
 |
OSPF Area 0
 |
R3


# Step 1 - EIGRP to OSPF

On R2:

router ospf 1
 redistribute eigrp 100 subnets


# Step 2 - OSPF to EIGRP

On R2:

router eigrp 100
 redistribute ospf 1 metric 10000 100 255 1 1500


# Step 3 - Verify on R3

show ip route

show ip route ospf

show ip ospf database


# Step 4 - Verify on R1

show ip route

show ip route eigrp


# Expected Route Types

OSPF redistributed routes:

O E1

or

O E2


EIGRP redistributed routes:

D EX


# Troubleshooting

Remove the redistribution statement.

Verify which routes disappear.

Restore redistribution.

Verify convergence.

Modify the redistribution metric.

Observe changes in route selection.
